OL,3,AIran-linked hackers behind cyber attack
OL,4,Athat shut down power plant, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA small power plant has been shut down
OL,7,Fduring a cyber attack.
OL,9,FThe government said that at no point
OL,10,Fwas there a risk to the UK's energy
OL,11,Fsystem, but the Department for Energy
OL,12,FSecurity and Net Zero (DESNZ) has
OL,13,Fcontacted power companies to advise
OL,14,Fthem about the risk of cyber attacks.
OL,16,FThe Daily Telegraph reported that the
OL,17,Fattack, which took place last month,
OL,18,Fwas carried out by hackers affiliated
OL,19,Fto the Iranian regime.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
