OL,3,AIran-linked hackers behind cyber attack
OL,4,Athat shut down power plant, reports say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor security reasons, neither the
OL,7,Fgovernment nor the National Cyber
OL,8,FSecurity Centre, which deals with
OL,9,Fattacks on critical infrastructure,
OL,10,Fwould give further details of the site
OL,11,Faffected. However this was not an
OL,12,Fattack on an essential service such as
OL,13,Fa large power station.
